{"unit_id":"Zilize__parallax-dsh#feature-1","repo":"Zilize/parallax-dsh","commit":"023ffadd6dea3af30587b89feb6073ffdd142c68","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Parallax 的功能「本地 arXiv 语料检索」：按关键词、日期和分类从已抓取的本机语料召回论文，并可按 arXiv ID 查看摘要。通过 parallax 工具的 search、paper 操作触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:140","src/ingest/corpus.ts:58"]}
{"unit_id":"Zilize__parallax-dsh#feature-2","repo":"Zilize/parallax-dsh","commit":"023ffadd6dea3af30587b89feb6073ffdd142c68","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Parallax 的功能「按日抓取 arXiv 元数据」：选择分类范围和日期区间，逐日分页抓取并显示覆盖日历、任务进度；已覆盖日期可跳过。通过 parallax_ingest 或侧栏 Ingest 面板触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/ingest/tool.ts:130","src/ingest/runner.ts:120","src/ingest/routes.ts:15"]}
{"unit_id":"Zilize__parallax-dsh#feature-3","repo":"Zilize/parallax-dsh","commit":"023ffadd6dea3af30587b89feb6073ffdd142c68","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Parallax 的功能「构建可审计论文集合」：可从论文 ID 建集合，按关键词、日期或分类过滤，也可合并多个集合或从基集合中减去一个集合。通过 parallax_set 的 create 操作触发，每次变更保存为图中的新节点。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/sets/tool.ts:200","src/sets/tool.ts:300"]}
{"unit_id":"Zilize__parallax-dsh#feature-4","repo":"Zilize/parallax-dsh","commit":"023ffadd6dea3af30587b89feb6073ffdd142c68","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Parallax 的功能「抽样试判与 AI 精筛」：对候选论文先抽样试判并查看概率和边界论文，再按纳入标准启动 Jev 筛选。通过 parallax_set 的 trial、judge 操作触发，结果以后台任务运行。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/sets/tool.ts:200","src/sets/tool.ts:300"]}
{"unit_id":"Zilize__parallax-dsh#feature-5","repo":"Zilize/parallax-dsh","commit":"023ffadd6dea3af30587b89feb6073ffdd142c68","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Parallax 的功能「AI 论文分类」：将筛选集合按用户定义的 2–12 个类别执行单标签或多标签判断，并为各类别生成输出节点。通过 parallax_set 的 classify 操作触发，判定由 Jev 后台完成。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/sets/tool.ts:200","src/sets/tool.ts:300"]}
{"unit_id":"Zilize__parallax-dsh#feature-6","repo":"Zilize/parallax-dsh","commit":"023ffadd6dea3af30587b89feb6073ffdd142c68","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Parallax 的功能「检查和导出集合」：在侧栏查看检索图、集合成员和判定状态，并将选定集合导出为 JSON 论文列表。通过 parallax_set 的 inspect、members、export 操作及右侧栏画布触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/sets/tool.ts:200","src/sets/routes.ts:62","src/client/pane.tsx:1"]}
{"unit_id":"Zilize__parallax-dsh#feature-7","repo":"Zilize/parallax-dsh","commit":"023ffadd6dea3af30587b89feb6073ffdd142c68","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Parallax 的功能「文献研究 skill」：提供按需读取的研究指南和案例，帮助 agent 做阅读清单、主题综述或趋势检索。通过 /parallax-skills 命令或 parallax 工具的 doc 操作加载。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/skills/provider.ts:1","src/client/skill-command.tsx:71","src/tools.ts:140"]}
{"unit_id":"Zilize__parallax-dsh#feature-8","repo":"Zilize/parallax-dsh","commit":"023ffadd6dea3af30587b89feb6073ffdd142c68","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Parallax 的功能「本地覆盖与判定记录」：在右侧栏显示抓取日期覆盖、论文集合图和 Jev 判定进度，用户可浏览历史流程与单篇论文的分类结果。通过 History、Ingest 和 Build graph 面板查看。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/main.tsx:175","src/sets/routes.ts:23","src/ingest/routes.ts:15"]}
